'''EVA Angel Enemies''' (使徒 ''Shito'', '''Apostles''') are a type of [[Enemy Units|Enemy Unit]] exclusive to the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]].

The only ability to specifically affect EVA Angels is [[:Category:EVA Angel Killer Cats|EVA Angel Killer]], which increases damage against them to x5 and reduces damage taken from them to 0.2x.

EVA Angel is not considered a trait, but unlike [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]], [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]], [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] and [[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]], it never overlaps with other types, meaning any ability that targets enemies by trait will have no effect against EVA Angels.

==Trivia==
*In ''Evangelion'', these godlike, otherworldly entities are simply named "Angels". The name change to "EVA Angels" in [[The Battle Cats]] was necessary to avoid confusion with the already-existing [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy type.
*When EVA Angels are destroyed, they turn into intersecting crimson beams, which then despawn.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], EVA Angel goes unused in a spritesheet that displays all enemy types and abilities.
